# Tor configuration for the Understoria onion sidecar
# (docs/tor-onion.md). Service-only: SocksPort 0 means this tor is
# NOT a client proxy — it exists solely to publish the onion service
# and relay its traffic to Caddy's onion vhost.
RunAsDaemon 0
SocksPort 0
Log notice stdout

# The onion identity lives here (named volume `tor-keys`).
# hs_ed25519_secret_key in this directory IS the community's
# censorship-resistant address — back it up like DATABASE_KEY
# (escrowed, away from the database backups), and see the rotation
# procedure in docs/tor-onion.md before deleting anything.
HiddenServiceDir /var/lib/tor/understoria/
HiddenServicePort 80 caddy:8080
